  "text": "Everything the team makes lands here, newest first, and look at the top group waiting for you. That's a house rule, not a setting. It drafts and it shows you. You send and you approve. It never posts for you, never emails for you, never deletes anything of yours. Videos, images, pages, writing messages, reports, filter by the kind of thing or just search for it. 136 workers back there and not one of them can speak as you without your word on it.",
